  energyFullMessages:
  - title: "\u26A1 Energy Full!"
    body: Your energy is fully recharged. Ready to play?
  - title: "Fully Charged! \U0001F50B"
    body: Your energy is maxed out. Let's go!
  - title: "Ding! Fully reloaded \U0001F50B"
    body: Grab your phone, All your energy is waiting for you!
  dailyReminderMessages:
  - title: "New High Score? \U0001F3C6"
    body: Can you beat your best? Play a quick round!
  - title: "Break time? \u2615"
    body: Kick back and come join the fun!
  - title: "Game On! \U0001F3AE"
    body: Take a quick break and set a new record today.
  - title: "Just dropping by! \U0001F44B"
    body: Come play a quick round. We saved your spot!
